  "prefLabel": "Adm 606.09 Assignments and Subcontracts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 606.09 Assignments and Subcontracts. A vendor shall not assign or otherwise transfer any interest in any agreement or contract with the state without the prior written consent of the state, and no work required by any contract or agreement with the state shall be subcontracted without the prior written consent of the state.\n\nSource. #8310, eff 5-11-05; ss by #10364, eff 7-1-13; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm600.html"
